; RUN: @iriec --target mos6502 --emit=asm @file

; Corpus: llvm-mos-reference/pressure/many-calls
; Four calls, with all four args needing to survive every call. Maximal
; caller-saved pressure: forces a cluster of spills around the JSRs; watch
; where Irie parks the live args across each call.
;
; CHECK pins Irie's current --emit=asm output (characterization / golden).
; Compare against ext/llvm-mos-reference/pressure/many-calls.s; close gaps via irie-report.

; CHECK: g:
; CHECK:     RTS
; CHECK:
; CHECK: many_calls:
; CHECK:     TAY
; CHECK:     LDA $14
; CHECK:     PHA
; CHECK:     LDA $15
; CHECK:     PHA
